{"name":"video_apply_ops","description":"Edit a video through the same operations as the editor. Supply baseRev from video_get_doc. A conflict returns the fresh document and rev; re-plan, never blindly retry old ops. label describes the step in undo history. No hosted LLM is invoked. edit_video ops (each op is an object with an \"op\" field; seconds at the doc fps):\ntitle {value}\nbrand {colors?: {primary,secondary,text,background}, fonts?: {heading,body,display,numerals,serif,mono,accent}, logos?: {light?: asset id|null, dark?: asset id|null}, motion?: calm|default|punchy}\nadd_scene {block, after?: scene id|\"start\"|\"end\", seconds?, props?, transition?: none|fade|slide|wipe|zoom|diagonal-wipe, transition_seconds?}\nadd_media_scene {asset, after?: scene id|\"start\"|\"end\", seconds?, fit?: cover|contain, transition?}  a full-frame scene showing an uploaded image or clip (asset is an id from the document's media)\nadd_layer {block, scene, offset?, seconds?, props?, region?}  or {block, at, seconds?} to pin it across scenes\ntext {target, field, value}  target is a scene id or layer id\nset_prop {target, key, value}\nbind {target, key, binding: colors.primary|colors.secondary|colors.text|colors.background|fonts.heading|fonts.body|fonts.display|fonts.numerals|fonts.serif|fonts.mono|fonts.accent|null}\nscene_length {scene, seconds}\nfit_length {seconds}  stretches or trims the holds of all scenes\nlayer_timing {layer, offset?, seconds?}\ntransition {scene, kind: none|fade|slide|wipe|zoom|diagonal-wipe, seconds?, timing?: linear|spring, direction?: right|left|top|bottom, all?: true}\nswap_block {target, block}\nregion {layer, region: full|center|upper-third|lower-third|left-half|right-half|corner-tl|corner-br, size?: 16:9|9:16|1:1}\nhide_in_size {layer, size, hidden}\nmove_scene {scene, to}  to is the 1-based position\nremove {id}\nduplicate {id}\nmusic {track: name from the music list | null, db?}\nadd_audio {role: voice|music, asset}  put an uploaded audio file (asset id from the document's media) on the timeline\nasset_slot {scene, slot, asset: asset id|null}  fill a media field of a scene block (e.g. a phone screen) with an uploaded image or clip\naudio {id, db?, fade_in?, fade_out?, duck?, fit_to_video?}\nsplit_audio {id, at_frame}\nexport_sizes {sizes: [16:9|9:16|1:1]}\nvideo {fade_out?, background?: hex|null}\ncaptions {items?: [{text,startMs,endMs}], position?, per_page?, lines?, remove?}\nreplace_text {find, replace}\nnote {label}  explain without changing anything","parameters":{"properties":{"baseRev":{"exclusiveMinimum":0,"type":"integer"},"force":{"items":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":80,"type":"array"},"label":{"default":"Edit video","maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"ops":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"properties":{"label":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"meta":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"op":{"enum":["note"],"type":"string"}},"required":["op","label"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"op":{"enum":["title"],"type":"string"},"value":{"maxLength":80,"type":"string"}},"required":["op","value"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"colors":{"properties":{"background":{"type":"string"},"primary":{"type":"string"},"secondary":{"type":"string"},"text":{"type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"fonts":{"properties":{"accent":{"type":"string"},"body":{"type":"string"},"display":{"type":"string"},"heading":{"type":"string"},"mono":{"type":"string"},"numerals":{"type":"string"},"serif":{"type":"string"}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"logos":{"properties":{"dark":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"light":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"required":[],"type":"object"},"motion":{"enum":["calm","default","punchy"],"type":"string"},"op":{"enum":["brand"],"type":"string"}},"required":["op"],"type":"object"},{"properties":{"after":{"type":"string"},"block":{"type":"string"},"id":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"op":{"enum":["add_scene"],"type":